{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程发明","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"machines-and-inventions","title":"机械与发明","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/engineering/machines-and-inventions","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"visions-of-flight","title":"飞行的梦想","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/engineering/visions-of-flight","wordCount":1630,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 工程发明\n\n作为卓越的工程师与发明家，达·芬奇构思了无数超越时代的设计。本章考察其工程贡献。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"机械与发明\"——他从军事到民用、充满想象力的工程构想。第二篇文档讲述\"飞行的梦想\",呈现他对飞行的痴迷研究与飞行器设计这一动人篇章。\n"}